invariant: INV-36
file: chapulin_cfg.zig
catches: test/zig-build-check.sh
reason: The ch_cfg builder copies a list longer than its Limits cap
  into a session's storage, where a release build writes past the
  array and a test build panics. unit.zig requires error.Invalid for
  the first anchor list, ALPN list and chain over each cap.

--- old
    if (items.len > room.len) return error.Invalid;
--- new
    if (items.len > room.len + 1) return error.Invalid;
